## 613.5 Lucas–Puiseux 黄金逼近

```lean
theorem lucas_root_approximates_golden_shift
    (H m : ℕ) (hH : 0 < H)
    (hm : 0 < m) (hmeven : Even m) :
    let delta := Real.goldenRatio ^ (-(H : ℤ))
    let root := (1 / lucas (m * H)) ^ (1 / (m : ℝ))
    0 < delta - root ∧
    delta - root <
      delta ^ (2 * m + 1) / m
```

